  "description": "Introducing the next big thing in big wheel BMX – the Hooligan® series. Whether you're a heritage BMXer or a young ripper on a rideout, you’ll be right at home on Hooligan. The Hooligan Fat features a lightweight aluminum BMX frame, 4-inch fat tires on 26\" wheels, and modern geometry for the perfect fusion of stoke and comfort.\nBig BMX and fat tire bike rolled into one with modern BMX comfort and geometry. Suggested rider height 5'4\" - 6'2\"\nDurable, lightweight Tectonic T1 aluminum frame (23\" top tube length) with threadless aluminum alloy fork are ready to hit the streets\nSingle-speed drivetrain with aluminum three-piece crank offers performance while keeping things simple\nMonstrous 4\" wide tires on aluminum 26\" wheels with mechanical disc brakes (160 mm rotor) offer all-weather stopping power and speed control",
